{"parentUuid":"e327394f-c21d-4de1-81b3-68d221c9410e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdNzHLikWiGsSZHcVCDnX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NgTSKmk6WgER85Sm5Kgjf2","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\delivery\\tasks\\L7.md","content":"---\nid: L7\nepic: EP-L\nmilestone: M4\nokr: O2.KR2.1\ndeps: [L0, B0]\nauthority: agent-ok\nallowlist: [server/coordination/lib/loop_claim.mjs, server/coordination/lib/compaction.mjs, tests/loop_claim/, scripts/gates/l7.mjs]\ntools: [node]\nsandbox: worktree\nverify: node scripts/gates/l7.mjs\nbudget: 350\n---\n\n# L7 — Single-winner loop claim + compaction budget\n\n## Goal\nConcurrent machines claim a loop turn under an exactly-once (single-winner) protocol so two machines\nnever train/merge against the substrate simultaneously — by reusing the B0 `wx` atomic-lease claim,\nnot a new mechanism. Plus a stated storage/compaction budget (append-only on a finite drive), with\ncompaction itself additive and journalled. R43 + R42.\n\n## Context pointers (never inline content)\n- Design: architecture/SOLUTION-longview-self-learning.md §4.5 (single-winner) + §4.7 (compaction budget)\n- Reuse verbatim: server/coordination/lib/ledger.mjs lease protocol (leases/<task_id>.json, wx create, 15-min expiry/heartbeat)\n- Well-known claim id: flywheel-turn; requirements R43 (exactly-once), R42 (compaction)\n\n## TDD plan\n1. Claim-race test red: N concurrent claimants on flywheel-turn → exactly one winner, losers walk away.\n2. Expiry test: a stale lease (expires_at past) is reclaimable, still exactly one winner after the race.\n3. Compaction test: compaction is journalled and additive — pre-compaction state is reconstructable.\n4. Budget test: storage crossing the configured budget raises a flagged warning (not a silent collision).\n\n## Acceptance (BDD — every Scenario must map to an automated test)\n```gherkin\nFea