_failed, alerts.\n\n## Acceptance (BDD — every Scenario must map to an automated test)\n```gherkin\nFeature: the loop turns reactively and on a backstop, alive-checked, fail-clean\n  Scenario: reactive and cron triggers both advance a turn\n    Given a new staged manifest and, separately, a scheduled sweep\n    When each fires\n    Then a loop turn starts, each having taken the flywheel-turn claim\n  Scenario: only one machine runs a turn\n    Given two daemons racing on the claim\n    When they trigger concurrently\n    Then exactly one advances the turn\n  Scenario: a wedged job is detected by resource, not by logs\n    Given a job whose CPU-time is flat and artifacts/mtime are stale while its log looks quiet\n    When the watchdog checks liveness\n    Then it reports stalled, not alive\n  Scenario: a wedge aborts clean\n    Given a detected wedge\n    When the dead-man switch fires\n    Then the job is stopped, the lease released, run_failed emitted, and an alert raised — the box is not wedged\n```\n\n## Out of scope\nThe training-contamination guard (L11), promotion (L12/L13), the dashboard (L14). Orchestration +\nliveness only; the daemon calls existing stage skills, it does not reimplement them.\n\n## Handoff\nVerifier re-runs `node scripts/gates/l10.mjs` with fixtures simulating a wedge (flat CPU-time, stale\nmtime) and confirms the watchdog reports stalled and the dead-man abort fires clean (lease released).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1020,"cache_read_input_tokens":198722,"output_tokens":1365,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1020,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1365,"cache_read_input_tokens":198722,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1020,"cache_creation":{