  writes; keeps one storage grain + one schema story; **DuckDB `SELECT FROM 'executions.jsonl'` is a\n  measure-first fallback**, never the default). **§5** gives the KEL envelope (bi-temporal + HLC +\n  time_confidence + authorship + schema_version + prev-hash), CAS/index/manifest layout, delta cursor,\n  the `executions.jsonl` record shape, served-model/promotion record.\n  **§6** = new epic **EP-L**, tasks **L0–L14** across the 3 waves (wave-1 spine L0→L1→{L2,L3,L4}→L5→L6\n  + L7), milestone **M4** (needs additive w0-validator milestone-enum bump), with L0 + L2 drafted as\n  full W0 contracts inline. Every R1–R45 mapped (§4.8 table).\n- **Phasing:** wave 1 = staging (R17–R21) + delta (R8–R11) + execution tagging (R12–R16), with\n  Tier-1 guards R38–R41 slotted into wave 1 (§9.5). Wave 3 = the closed loop + agent loops.\n- **Delivery doctrine:** dogfood the flywheel — house model carries high-volume work, frontier\n  sessions carry design/gates/verification; R38 (authorship-provenance / collapse guard) is in force\n  from the first house-authored session. Builds on [[ep-t-progress]] + [[t480-trainer-stack]].\n\n**Wave-1 spine AUTHORED to the board (2026-07-25, owner accepted design as-is).** New epic\n`delivery/epics/EP-L.md`, milestone `delivery/milestones/M4-flywheel.md`, contracts\n`delivery/tasks/L0–L7.md`, `TRACEABILITY.md` row (`O1+O2 | flywheel-substrate | EP-L | M4`),\n`plan-deps.json` L0–L7 deps. **L0 in READY** (zero-dep, human-signed, spine root); **L1–L7 in AUTHORED**.\nDeps: L0→{L1,L4}, L1→{L2,L3}, {L0,L4}→L5→L6, {L0,B0}→L7. `authority`: L0/L1/L3 human-signed, rest\nagent-ok. **`w0` milestone enum bumped `…|M3`→`…|M4` at authoring time** (not deferred to L0, else 8 M4\ncontracts red the gate) — `node scripts/gates/w0.mjs` GREEN, 74 contracts. Gate scripts `scripts/gates/l0–l7.mjs`\nare NOT yet written (each task writes its own, red-first). Waves 2–3 (L8–L14) authored at their own checkpoints.\n\n**Wave-1 committed + pushed** to `origin/main` @ `4159ee2` (design §4–§6 + EP-L/M4 + L0–L7).\n\n**ALL of EP-L now authored + pushed to `origin/main` (2026-07-25):** wave 1 @ `4159ee2` (L0–L7, M4),\nwave 2 @ `6c7041a` (L8–L9, M5), wave 3 @ `6848841` (L10–L14, M6). `w0` GREEN, **81 contracts**.\n- **Milestone-per-wave:** M4 (v2.3.0 substrate), M5 (v2.4.0 bi-temporal), M6 (v2.5.0 closed loop).\n  `validate.mjs` enum now `M1..M6`.\n- **Wave 3:** L10 flywheel-daemon (trigger+liveness), L11 collapse-guard (verifier gate + house-fraction\n  cap), L12 human-signed promotion+rollback (python/router), L13 decision function + additive eval growth,\n  L14 triad dashboard. L10–L13 human-signed, L14 agent-ok.\n- **Board state:** L0 in READY (human-signed spine root, zero-dep); L1–L14 in AUTHORED (deps unmet).\n- **Gate scripts `scripts/gates/l0–l14`(.mjs/.py) NOT written** — each task authors its own red-first.\n\n**L0 DONE + merged (2026-07-25).** KEL truth substrate built (branch `task/L0` @ `7ed6431`), then\n**independently verified by a fresh-context subagent `claude-l0-verifier`** — reproduced gate GREEN 7/7,\nown negative probes (middle-line tamper → badLine=3, missing-field/bad-enum reject, tombstone removes\nsubject), and a **mutation test** (disabled the chain check → gate RED, reverted → GREEN) proving the\ngate non-vacuous; allowlist-clean (473 insertions, 5 files). Merged `--no-ff` @ `1604dec`, board\nVERIFY→DONE @ `dea40e5`, pushed. Files live on main: `server/coordination/lib/kel.mjs` (+ SPEC, schema,\ntests, gate). Caveat logged: fresh-context subagent but same harness/model family as author (not\ncross-harness). Known design limit: last-line edit undetectable by prev-chain (needs B1 head-hash anchor).\n**L1 + L4 promoted to READY** @ `088bdc8` (dep L0 DONE). w0 GREEN, 81 contracts.\n\n**L1 DONE + merged (2026-07-25, owner directed \"L1\" = the human signature).** CAS staging built\n(`server/coordination/lib/staging.mjs`: casStore/stageSession/openStaging/initManifest; blobs/sha256/hh/hash\nde-dup, index/<machine>/<date