rovenance + record-served tagging; authorship.mjs + additive exec_register strict-build) merged `b6e2e5e`\n— verifier `claude-l6-verifier` ran the L5 REGRESSION (shared exec_register.mjs) GREEN + mutation test.\nThe 8 substrate lib modules on main: kel, staging, poison_gate, delta, durability, exec_register,\nloop_claim, compaction. All 8 gates l0–l7 GREEN; w0 exit 0, 81 contracts. Board HEAD `fa2386e`.\n\nWave-1 delivers: KEL truth log (L0) → CAS staging on D: (L1) → poison gate (L2) + durability (L3) →\ndelta cursors (L4) → execution register (L5) → authorship tagging (L6) + single-winner claim/compaction (L7).\n\n**READY now: B1/Q1/E0 (older) + L8 (wave-2 bi-temporal projectors, agent-ok).** Wave 2 = L8→L9; wave 3 =\nL10–L14. The author→independent-verify→merge loop is proven **EIGHT times** via fresh subagents (all\nsame-harness-family caveat, fresh context, not cross-harness). Self-caught process error (logged `afc747a`):\nan L5-claim board edit dropped the L7 READY line (w0 caught it) — now use `node gate >/dev/null; W0=$?`\nnever `| tail` when gating on exit code. Transient Bash-classifier outage mid-L6 handled by waiting+retry.\n\n**Next action:** owner picks — wave 2 (L8 bi-temporal projectors, then L9) opens the time-travel layer;\nor pause. Stage these design+build sessions as tagged training material (§8 dogfood).\n","numLines":110,"startLine":1,"totalLines":110}},"displayPath":"..\\..\\.claude\\projects\\C--Users-nsdha-OneDrive-binary16\\memory\\longview-flywheel-design-ready.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5a698f09-296d-4602-b8e9-0644a4a67cf8","timestamp":"2026-07-25T20:37:59.453Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16","sessionId":"468ee845-7d82-4724-a78a-d2a9fbbb431e","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"logical-weaving-pancake"}
