. **Remediate =\n  re-run backup** (robocopy idempotent, copies only changed). Run verify weekly + before each\n  LONGVIEW/training run. Same doctrine as the flywheel's L3 durability (replicate→checksum→restore).\n- **Known: `~/.claude` shows DRIFT/verified=false when a Claude session is live** (it is written\n  continuously as I work) — a point-in-time backup of a live dir is expected to differ; mem0ray +\n  sessions_v1 are stable and verify True.\n\n**T480 backup done + verified (2026-07-26):** `D:\\backups\\sessions-2026-07-26` — claude 72→(live-drift),\nmem0ray 80,555 verified, sessions_v1 237,194 verified; total ~317,822 files / 7.6 GB. Mirrored to\n`F:\\backups\\sessions-2026-07-26`.\n\n**ASUS backup (owner runs it there):** connect F: to the ASUS, paste the prompt into a Claude session:\nfind the drive containing `\\backups\\session-backup.ps1`, then\n`session-backup.ps1 -Mode backup -Dest <DRV>backups -Suffix asus`, then `-Mode verify` the snapshot,\nreport the MANIFEST.json totals. It auto-skips the T480-only `D:\\benny-home` source.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1604,"cache_read_input_tokens":566602,"output_tokens":1670,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1604,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1670,"cache_read_input_tokens":566602,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1604,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1604},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdQms5oGEKT1CyZsYZDZu","type":"assistant","uuid":"90374b63-0c13-40d3-b1a9-6b681f1482cc","timestamp":"2026-07-26T13:48:55.734Z","effort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary